# Contract Proof

This app-plan workpack reuses the shared app/game contracts. No app-only
parallel contract was created.

Validation:

```text
cargo test -p ocentra-parent-agent-protocol app_game -- --nocapture
PASS: 10 tests.
```

App boundary:

- Inventory remains not-use.
- Running remains not-foreground.
- Foreground remains not-content.
- Launcher evidence remains not-game without child-game proof.
